      "cost": 50,
      "summary": "[title] is too dumb for its own good",
      "excerpt": "[title] is another of those romcoms whose main focus is the comedy and every character is a single joke and none of them are funny. But this series is intended to be stupid, right? Well, yes, but the jokes are still terrible, and it’s not like I can’t enjoy some dumb comedies, but every time I got to the punchline of a joke in this series I honestly wasn’t impressed, nor I was laughing...",
